# Gemini API key for the portfolio Terminal LLM.
# The terminal answers questions strictly from about.txt (file-grounded).
# If this key is set, Gemini 2.0 Flash is used to produce the final answer.
# If it is missing or the call fails, the terminal falls back to extracting
# the most relevant snippet directly from about.txt — still file-grounded.
#
# Get a key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
